#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:5 243bc7ee317f40758a93b471a023735a
msgid "Guided mode"
msgstr "Guided 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:7 b0c04a752eb24aaea7422dc576130009
msgid ""
"Guided mode is designed to allow ground stations or :ref:`companion "
"computers <common-companion-computers>` to control the vehicle."
msgstr "Guided 模式旨在允许地面站或 :ref:`伴随计算机 <common-companion-computers>` 控制车辆。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:10 c9d521010dc343c2a389d64086fe4af5
msgid "Sending Commands from the Ground Station"
msgstr "从地面站发送命令"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:12 3a1bb7bd2ac84fc08df8ca1472d0ee73
msgid ""
"Most ground stations support commanding the vehicle to drive to a location "
"specified by clicking on the map.  If using the Mission Planner:"
msgstr "大多数地面站支持通过点击地图上的位置来命令车辆驶向该位置。如果使用 Mission Planner："

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:14 0ade583eae224852a5b93cebca2e3830
msgid ""
"connect to the vehicle with a :ref:`telemetry radio <common-telemetry-"
"landingpage>`"
msgstr "通过 :ref:`遥测无线电 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 连接到车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:15 63392e830fc543b6a259dcb7e9d7409e
msgid ""
"from the Flight Data screen, right-mouse-button click on the map and select "
"\"Fly To Here\"."
msgstr "在飞行数据界面，右键点击地图并选择「Fly To Here」。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:16 1898a4bab1c0440982ac76cfa427d9a3
msgid ""
"the vehicle will switch to Guided mode and attempted to drive to the "
"location specified."
msgstr "车辆将切换到 Guided 模式并尝试驶向指定位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:17 955df0208ab84bcb8c804e7d9e62aff3
msgid ""
"once at the destination it will hold position if a surface vehicle, or "
"loiter/circle around the destination if it is a boat."
msgstr "到达目的地后，若为地面车辆则保持位置，若为船则在目的地周围 Loiter/绕圈。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:22 dfddb1bae0e34778ad5826a88249ac23
msgid ""
"The ground station will normally set the vehicle to Guided mode before the "
"target destination is sent meaning it is not necessary to set up Guided mode"
" on the :ref:`transmitter mode switch <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"地面站通常会在发送目标位置之前将车辆设置为 Guided 模式，这意味着无需在 :ref:`发射器模式开关 <common-rc-"
"transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` 上设置 Guided 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:25 87b1576d29c64dcdbd78280488faeac4
msgid "Speed"
msgstr "速度"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:27 1e51d626817b424b82604e33497758a8
msgid ""
"While the vehicle is travelling, the user can increase the vehicle's speed "
"by raising the transmitter's throttle stick to between 75% and 100%.  At 75%"
" the vehicle will remain at it's configured speed (i.e. :ref:`WP_SPEED "
"<WP_SPEED>` or :ref:`CRUISE <CRUISE_SPEED>` if :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` is"
" zero, versions of Rover after 3.5.1 use only :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>`), "
"this linearly increases to the vehicle's maximum speed as the pilot's "
"throttle stick reaches 100%."
msgstr ""
"在车辆行进过程中，用户可以将遥控器的油门杆提高到 75% 到 100% 之间来增加车辆速度。在 75% 时车辆将保持其配置速度（即 "
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>`，或当 :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` 为零时使用 :ref:`CRUISE "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>`，Rover 3.5.1 之后的版本仅使用 :ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>`），随着飞手油门杆达到 "
"100%，速度线性增加到车辆最大速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:30 ed454499638c4f2b94baa9e9f7b70541
msgid "Other controls"
msgstr "其他控制"

